eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lgz99uhFcK8Q7kNvwFSq6g2&_nc_oc=AdmAx1W7jphG-PWU7ZnE0icE6BMU7T8hV4VJF5p9ZkoUpR5bD3elWYo1-yFRerYZa1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwLSPYmLYzd4xwSU-8uUtEBqinMoVzok3VkBNNPxEaQWQ&oe=69BA7FDC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CjbEyzX0pBwQ7kNvwHdNc1g&_nc_oc=Admht7UYXe_iJr06VJEayR6YLgmKdR9J58-Nd9tr0Rtnf6Vte9hJ5087Nr-Ieb2uSdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyo7eYE3dB2Dj9CgtF0wuz7oi4h0wQYfe6AUusF_neYjQ&oe=69BA92A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TNlXvNNMo5wQ7kNvwE3MKW3&_nc_oc=AdnwFhwKy5v1K_1P_x3p34eADIqbzvoKTiX9wVcS-P-x7hYHe-iqMc8WFvM5O70dQjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyB9VovKrHE8_tuXNKWfrcI4UJUKETt2jCZJxtoxLr-FA&oe=69BA86EC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9IG8MIR41tMQ7kNvwHK2fSi&_nc_oc=Adk26Q18v3dNl5lwyDQwiIS0L9yaNZyecP2qJOAsLxnpC8wILMvZpaGVKX4FqbdIEuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxH67AykoOoWK_ydBYXc4l6uRwSxhQl5L3kYgXO3eN22Q&oe=69BA8CAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vu2W8w_BjRQQ7kNvwFwUOhR&_nc_oc=AdnlETkX8h6Z8xV-fvI9jT3tRdNNIwyQJd9yCGOq3cYIZM6hnGjeG0IVLRE__DMO4Fc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy7R-ZnY5dyP6LOkNVFbCVIlCqlhAi3ZKSYaGpxjkJ2dg&oe=69BAAC56"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam